{'symbol': 'BWA', 'date': '2021-11-18 13:16:00', 'title': 'BORGWARNER AWARDED GRANT TO LAUNCH E-PRODUCT IN CADILLAC, MICHIGAN PLANT', 'text': 'CADILLAC, MICH., NOV. 18, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BORGWARNER THERMAL SYSTEMS HAS BEEN AWARDED A GRANT TO GROW ITS ELECTRIC VEHICLE BUSINESS AND IS SET TO LAUNCH A NEW HIGH-VOLTAGE COOLANT HEATER (HVCH) AT ITS EXISTING FACILITY IN CADILLAC, MICHIGAN.'}